@startuml
' === Sequence Diagram: Kelola Pegawai ===
actor Admin
participant "Halaman Kelola Pegawai" as PegawaiPage
participant Sistem
database Database

Admin -> PegawaiPage : Buka menu pegawai
PegawaiPage -> Sistem : Ambil daftar pegawai
Sistem -> Database : Query data pegawai
Admin -> PegawaiPage : Edit / Hapus pegawai
PegawaiPage -> Sistem : Lakukan update / delete
Sistem -> Database : Simpan perubahan
Sistem -> Admin : Tampilkan notifikasi aksi berhasil
@enduml